cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "symbulator: exact symbolic analysis of linear circuits"
abstract: >-
  A Python library, built on SymPy, for exact symbolic analysis of linear
  circuits: DC, AC (phasor), s-domain (Laplace) and transient analysis,
  Thevenin and Norton equivalents, two-port parameters, and inverse problems
  solved in the circuit's own system of equations. It is version 9 of
  Symbulator, first written for TI calculators in 1999, and keeps their
  circuit notation.
type: software
authors:
